Subject: [PATCH] urma: bond import without user-mode topo

(cherry picked from commit 97a26a04c5bdf3b9cf55c2aba67f3c60bd3a852a)
---
 src/urma/lib/urma/bond/bondp_api.c          | 146 +++++++-------------
 src/urma/lib/urma/bond/bondp_segment.c      | 127 ++++-------------
 src/urma/lib/urma/bond/bondp_types.h        |   3 -
